    <briefdescription>
<para>A label-based filter applied to incoming metric updates. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A filter matches when the metric update carries a label whose name equals <computeroutput>label</computeroutput> and whose value equals <computeroutput>value</computeroutput>. An empty <computeroutput>value</computeroutput> acts as a wildcard and matches any value for the given label name. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
